concepts.content:
In the continuous domain, there is a direct relationship between the Fourier transform of a function and the Fourier transform of its derivative:
$$
\frac{\partial \ell (x)}{\partial x}  
\xrightarrow{\mathscr{F}} 
j w \mathscr{L} (w)
$$

